    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50674" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vervex</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">berbex</span></b> 
		and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verbex</span></b> ),
		ēcis, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a wether.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 98</span></i>
			Müll.; id. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 189, 30</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 4, 2, 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Leg.
				2, 22, 55</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, a name for a stupid fellow, qs. <i>mutton-head</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Merc.
				3, 3, 6</span></i>; Auct. ap. <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Const. 17, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 10, 50</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
